# Google Places API (New) key, used by tooling/cli/pp-trip to resolve place
# names into coordinates. Copy this file to google-places.env and fill it in.
#
# Absent key is NOT an error: pp-trip falls back to Nominatim/OpenStreetMap,
# which handles beaches, temples and roads fine. It only misses small
# businesses (hostels, cafes), which is exactly what Google is here for.
#
# The live key belongs to Google Cloud project n8n-workflows-454504 and is
# restricted to places.googleapis.com. That project has NO billing account
# attached, which is deliberate: the key cannot be charged. If usage ever
# passed the free tier, calls would start failing instead of costing money.
#
# To mint a replacement:
#   gcloud services enable places.googleapis.com --project=n8n-workflows-454504
#   gcloud services api-keys create --project=n8n-workflows-454504 \
#     --display-name="trip-planner-cli" \
#     --api-target=service=places.googleapis.com
#   gcloud services api-keys get-key-string <KEY_RESOURCE_NAME>
GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY=
